   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding+complaint.category+complaint.text"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "I'm sorry to hear about his hip. About how long ago did the fall happen, and can you tell me a bit more about how it happened?",
