   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:infection.travel_14d+infection.contacts"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "I'm sorry to hear about his fall. Is he acting differently than usual, such as being more confused or sleepy, and how would you rate his pain on a scale of 0 to 10?",
