   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline+complaint.pain_rating"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "I'm sorry to hear he's in so much pain. Compared to his usual self, has he seemed more confused or sleepy lately?",
